## 14. Honest verdict (carried from review)
  STABLE CORE: 4-plane division of labour, 5 parameter-free rules, IVM-13, the 16 measured-dead kills,
  the baseline control run, and the verify/ type-token fit are the load-bearing claims.
  SPECULATIVE OVERLAY: THE TWELVE attributions (editorial), 'where meaning lives' framing, and any
  'no model at this scale' wording (a tautology, not a measurement). Treat those as framing, not findings.

